z}{\\text{d}x}=-{e}^{z}.\n$$\n\nThis differential equation is separable. So, we separate the variables and integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{e}^{-z}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}z}{\\text{d}x} & =1 \\\\ -\\int {e}^{-z}\\,\\text{d}z & =\\int \\text{d}x \\\\ {e}^{-z} & =x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we write the equation in terms of $y$ and $x$ using our original substitution, as follows:\n\n$$\n{e}^{3x-y}=x+C\n$$\n\nTherefore, $g(x,y)={e}^{3x-y}.$" 13194139535080 true] [17592186330180 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330181 13194139535080 true] [17592186330180 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330182 13194139535080 true] [17592186330180 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330183 13194139535080 true] [17592186330180 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330184 13194139535080 true] [17592186330180 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330185 13194139535080 true] [17592186330180 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535080 true] [17592186330180 1041 "selection" 13194139535080 true] [17592186330180 1104 #edb/ref 17592186330182 13194139535080 true] [17592186330180 1110 #uuid "97c3f21d-3d69-5152-b1af-5a1b985b60b6" 13194139535080 true] [17592186330181 1034 "3{e}^{3x-y}" 13194139535080 true] [17592186330181 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535080 true] [17592186330181 1111 #uuid "ee87797c-f636-5cdf-b2dc-da8ae75b2ee5" 13194139535080 true] [17592186330182 1034 "{e}^{3x-y}" 13194139535080 true] [17592186330182 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535080 true] [17592186330182 1111 #uuid "9e081cb1-bc06-564a-bd68-73f488b1a2af" 13194139535080 true] [17592186330183 1034 "-{e}^{3x-y}" 13194139535080 true] [17592186330183 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535080 true] [17592186330183 1111 #uuid "394b669e-28a7-5ceb-a0a1-895ef0c4e9da" 13194139535080 true] [17592186330184 1034 "{e}^{y-3x}" 13194139535080 true] [17592186330184 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535080 true] [17592186330184 1111 #uuid "2890a8da-e979-5809-a868-1392bdce9f26" 13194139535080 true] [17592186330185 1034 "-\\frac{1}{3}{e}^{y-3x}" 13194139535080 t